Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `x` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/generic_constructor_nested_argument_sees_active_write_place.jet:13:27
    |
 13 |     pair: Pair.new(x, see(x))
    |                           ^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `x` only once, or copy first with `x.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
